WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.385 --> 00:00:19.413
Zoom! shot down West Street.

2
00:00:20.494 --> 00:00:21.614
"What's Rocket Girl doing?"

3
00:00:21.874 --> 00:00:22.475
cried a man.

4
00:00:22.495 --> 00:00:24.336
"Is she chasing someone?"

5
00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:27.557
"I don't see anyone," said another person.

6
00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:30.559
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

7
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.933
Ka-boom! A mailbox blew up.

8
00:00:34.653 --> 00:00:35.734
Letters went everywhere.

9
00:00:36.795 --> 00:00:40.017
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams again.

10
00:00:40.938 --> 00:00:42.519
This time a garbage can blew up.

11
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.202
"Rocket Girl is destroying Metro City!"

12
00:00:47.563 --> 00:00:48.163
cried a woman.

13
00:00:48.183 --> 00:00:51.866
"She looks really angry," said a kid.

14
00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.708
Roxy landed and looked around.

15
00:00:56.429 --> 00:00:57.370
She stamped her foot.

16
00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.912
"Aargh!" Roxy cried.

17
00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.841
"This is the best episode ever!"

18
00:01:08.162 --> 00:01:08.822
said Jack.

19
00:01:09.862 --> 00:01:12.704
Roxy and her friends were watching Mighty Man at Jack's house.

20
00:01:12.724 --> 00:01:16.506
"I hope Mighty Man can stop the monster lizard!"

21
00:01:16.867 --> 00:01:17.447
said Mara.

22
00:01:19.068 --> 00:01:20.689
Roxy laughed.

23
00:01:20.709 --> 00:01:22.610
"Mighty Man always stops the monster.

24
00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.591
He's a superhero!"

25
00:01:25.572 --> 00:01:28.113
Just then a news reporter appeared on the TV screen.

26
00:01:30.214 --> 00:01:32.776
"We have some important news," said the reporter.

27
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:37.881
"Earlier today witnesses saw Rocket Girl trying to destroy Metro City."

28
00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:40.542
"What!" cried Terrell.

29
00:01:41.222 --> 00:01:42.983
"Rocket Girl would never do that!"

30
00:01:44.123 --> 00:01:45.623
The reporter was still talking.

31
00:01:45.643 --> 00:01:48.264
"One witness recorded this video.

32
00:01:49.204 --> 00:01:51.205
It shows Rocket Girl blowing things up.

33
00:01:52.785 --> 00:01:54.786
As you can see, she looks pretty angry.

34
00:01:55.646 --> 00:01:57.246
Nobody knows why she did this.

35
00:01:57.847 --> 00:02:00.187
But MBS News will be following the story!

36
00:02:01.147 --> 00:02:02.708
We now return to Mighty Man."

37
00:02:05.352 --> 00:02:06.693
Mighty Man came back on.

38
00:02:07.774 --> 00:02:10.036
But Roxy and her friends didn't pay much attention.

39
00:02:10.056 --> 00:02:15.680
"There's no way Rocket Girl would destroy Metro City," said Terrell.

40
00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.662
"I don't believe it!"

41
00:02:18.823 --> 00:02:19.564
Jack shrugged.

42
00:02:19.584 --> 00:02:21.705
"It was on the news."

43
00:02:22.766 --> 00:02:24.087
Terrell thought for a second.

44
00:02:24.107 --> 00:02:27.690
"Maybe she was chasing a bad guy," he said.

45
00:02:28.911 --> 00:02:29.872
Mara shook her head.

46
00:02:29.892 --> 00:02:32.814
"Nobody else was in the video."

47
00:02:33.615 --> 00:02:34.676
Terrell rubbed his chin.

48
00:02:35.528 --> 00:02:39.430
"Well, maybe the bad guy was really fast and got away."

49
00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.651
"A villain faster than Rocket Girl?"

50
00:02:42.951 --> 00:02:43.551
asked Mara.

51
00:02:43.571 --> 00:02:45.372
"No way!"

52
00:02:46.352 --> 00:02:47.653
Terrell looked at Roxy.

53
00:02:48.593 --> 00:02:49.454
She seemed upset.

54
00:02:49.474 --> 00:02:52.135
"Are you okay, Roxy?"

55
00:02:52.535 --> 00:02:53.175
asked Terrell.

56
00:02:54.376 --> 00:02:55.116
Roxy jumped.

57
00:02:55.136 --> 00:02:58.277
"Me? Yeah, I'm fine.

58
00:02:58.817 --> 00:03:01.859
Why?" Terrell looked at her suspiciously.

59
00:03:01.879 --> 00:03:05.160
"What do you think Rocket Girl was doing?

60
00:03:06.144 --> 00:03:08.306
You don't think she's a bad guy now, do you?"

61
00:03:09.587 --> 00:03:11.148
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

62
00:03:11.168 --> 00:03:16.213
"I'll be right back," said Roxy.

63
00:03:16.233 --> 00:03:18.435
"I need some water."

64
00:03:21.677 --> 00:03:24.480
Roxy went into Jack's kitchen and pressed the button on her watch.

65
00:03:29.104 --> 00:03:30.905
"Rocket Girl," said Mayor Bloom.

66
00:03:30.925 --> 00:03:33.628
"We're close to catching the Ghost Bandit.

67
00:03:34.644 --> 00:03:36.907
He just tried to rob the Metro City Mint.

68
00:03:37.888 --> 00:03:41.531
Police have the building surrounded, but they can't find him anywhere."

69
00:03:41.551 --> 00:03:44.094
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

70
00:03:44.114 --> 00:03:45.675
"I'm on my way!"
